  '**4 · The clerk who applies the rule, and she wrote this line.** _The district check stays with the registry and the new definition does not move it; if the wording changes, the registry gets the one-page list changed before the round opens, not after._ ⚠ **I had written _no change to anybody\'s duties_, which is true and covers nothing** — **and she has applied a rule for nine years from a list that was last reissued in 2019.**',
