out.push(A('**Rows 2 and 4 on both cards are occasions already, and rows 4 are the two that do the hardest work** — **naming somebody who could do part of it better, and naming a limit.** ⚠ **Rows 5 are the pair with nothing underneath them**: the room will try to supply an occasion, **and the useful finding is that it has to be supplied from the writer\'s life and cannot be supplied from the sentence.**'));
