// ===================== 22.6 =====================
out.push(pb());
out.push(h2('22.6  The whole proposal, assembled'));
out.push(S('Stage 1 · Get ready'));
out.push(A('**a** Open. ⚠ **Each room writes its order on the board.** **Four of ten put the ask first and two put the occasions first, and both orders are defensible** — **and both were abandoned by their own writers within the hour, which is the only way this cycle teaches: not by being told, but by reading their own second paragraph explaining their first.**'));
out.push(A('**b** Honest last paragraphs: **2** and **4**. ⚠ **Both say that nothing happens, and 4 says it twice.** **1 offers a meeting, 3 makes a refusal into a fault, and 5 asks for urgency** — **and the room should be asked what each of those three costs a reader who wants to say no, which is their peace.**'));
out.push(NOTE('⚠ **The order is the cycle and the reason is one sentence: the document goes in the order the reader needs, and the draft goes in the order of the writer\'s discovery.** **Those two orders are reverses of each other** — **remedy, qualifications, ask, problem against observation, costing, ask, exclusions, occasions** — **and a writer who sends the first has sent their own notes.** ⚠ **Do not assert this.** **Have four students read their own first two paragraphs aloud and let the room hear the second explaining the first; that is what moved four writers within the hour in this class, and no amount of being told would have.**'));
out.push(S('Language box · Practise'));
out.push(A('**1** ⚠ **Observation · costing · ask · exclusions · occasions · what happens if the answer is no.**   **2** **The ask is never first: an ask with no reason produces _why are you telling me this?_**   **3** ⚠ **The occasions are last, because by then the reader has asked for them out loud.**   **4** **The no paragraph: nothing happens, and nothing is threatened.**   **5** ⚠ **The one-page version, containing nothing that is not in the long one.**'));
out.push(S('Stage 3 · Practise (sample – Card A)'));
