out.push(A('**Rows 2 and 4 on both cards are sendable** — **and rows 4 are the short versions, where the piece doing the most work is the single occasion.** ⚠ **Rows 5 are the pair the cycle turns on**: both end in something the reader must do, urgency or a meeting, **and both replace the one paragraph that lets a reader refuse at no cost.**'));
