out.push(A('**b** ⚠ **That nobody has queried the write-offs for nine years, with nothing after it.** **It is true, it is already on page 2 of a document that has been sent** — **and there is exactly one person in the company who signs those approvals, so a paragraph of arithmetic about a procedure is a paragraph about his nine years.**'));
out.push(NOTE('⚠ **This is the tenth mediation of Book 2 and the first in which the forbidden sentence has already been written and sent.** **Do not soften that.** **The cycle has a remedy only because the document has not yet been circulated** — **and the room should be asked what would be true if the budget holder had passed page 2 to the depot on the twenty-sixth, which is that the first Mr Fattal would have known of it is a sentence about his own signature, from a man he has met twice.** ⚠ **Then the three findings, in this order.** **First: the person whose work changes was consulted and the person the document describes was not, and the reason is that the proposal does not touch him, it only describes him** — **which is why nobody thinks of such a person, in any organisation, ever.** **Second: the same two figures read both ways, and whoever reads them first decides which reading lasts.** **Third, and largest: the audit has been on the office\'s own list since 2019 with _no capacity_ beside it, so the remedy is the office\'s own and the document as it stands gives a young man the credit for it.** ⚠ **The repair is a citation and not an act of modesty: _the audit is item 4 of the office\'s list of 2019_.** **One clause, and the proposal becomes the office\'s idea with four weeks attached, which is the version that survives its writer leaving.** **And then Pair B, which exists so that the room cannot conclude that the lesson is _consult everybody_: on Pair B everybody was consulted and the proposal failed because the ask was outside the reader\'s power, which is 22.3 and not a failure of courtesy.**'));
